(text "STIMULUS\nAD9851 in serial mode (D0=D1=1, D2=0, data on D7), REFCLK 30 MHz from Si5351 CLK2, 6x PLL on -> 180 MHz.\nIOUT full scale 10.2 mA (RSET 3.92k) into 100 ohm (doubly terminated 200 ohm filter) -> ~1 Vpp.\n5th-order Butterworth LPF, fc 45 MHz, 200 ohm. Driver ADA4817 gain 2 -> ~2 Vpp, 49.9 ohm source (NODE_A).\nSN74LVC2T45 translate 3.3 V controller/clock signals to the 5 V DDS logic." (at 15 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid f0317aaf-34b5-492c-a417-4cfbb288613f))
)
